# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PulseBoard environment. Copy to `.env` and fill in.
# Bun (and Vite) load `.env` automatically.
# VITE_*  → exposed to the browser.   Others → server-only.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Supabase (database + auth) ───────────────────────────────
# Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-ANON-PUBLIC-KEY

# Service role key — used ONLY by `bun run seed`. Never ship to the client.
# (Same page, "service_role" secret.)
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=YOUR-SERVICE-ROLE-KEY

# ── Anthropic / Claude (Mood Map AI synthesis) ───────────────
# https://console.anthropic.com  → API Keys.  Optional: without it the
# Mood Map "Refresh" falls back to a deterministic local reshuffle.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-YOUR-KEY

# ── Mood Map signal agents (src/lib/signals.ts) ──────────────
# Each is OPTIONAL — without a key, that source shows representative sample data
# and is labelled "Sample" in the UI. Add a key to make it "Live".

# Reddit — free. reddit.com/prefs/apps → create a "script" app.
# REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
# REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Google Reviews — Google Places API + your business Place ID.
# GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=

# Google Trends — via SerpAPI (serpapi.com). Free tier available.
# SERPAPI_KEY=

# YouTube — free. Google Cloud Console → YouTube Data API v3.
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY=

# Discord — bot token + a channel ID the bot can read (bot must be in the server).
# DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN=
# DISCORD_CHANNEL_ID=
